    "text": "A file of nine cards sold in Japan to mark the second Neo expansion, Crossing the Ruins..., and Pokémon 3: The Movie (Emperor of the Crystal Tower: Entei in Japan), which opened there on 8 July 2000. Its cards are Pokémon from the film: Entei, Charizard, Pichu, three Unown, and Eevee with its evolutions Espeon and Umbreon.",
